notes.content:
Fixed a bug where the player might get stuck behind the wheel;
Fixed a bug where all the lights go down when you immediately find Demetria in a game;
Fixed a bug where the skill range can be amplified infinitely when pressed continuously;
Fixed a bug where the skill can be triggered while in shop;
Fixed a small translation error;
Adjusted controller mapping for UI navigation.

Hi Confettia visitors!

We are excited to announce that Illusion Carnival is now available in Polish, thanks to vahtyy's amazing translation work and the enthusiastic players who helped playtest it! Additionally, all English texts in the game have been proofread and polished with the help of Bloom and KeqiTheKombuPig. We hope this will bring players an improved game experience. If you find any translation errors, please report them to us in our [url=https://discord.gg/audUbxBVHY]Discord Server[/url]  or by the "Report Bugs" tab in game!

Here are the detailed patch notes for version 0.1.64:

Added Polish localization;
English localization proofread;
Adjusted splash screen duration;
Fixed a bug where items were unexpectedly retained in the second playthrough;
Fixed a bug where skills could be infinitely amplified when the game is paused;
Fixed a bug causing signs to twitch;
Fixed a bug where the player could become invincible if paused upon death;
Fixed a bug where clicking the screen with the mouse would inadvertently reset the camera view;
Fixed a bug where inputs were unresponsive during a cutscene at the end;
Fixed an issue where the pause menu could be opened during scene transitions;
Fixed a bug causing the camera to twitch when holding the skill key and triggering a dialogue;
Fixed a bug where displayed images could not be closed with the mouse.

Fixed a bug in dialogue;
Fixed a bug where you can pass through walls;
Fixed an issue where the confirm button disappears when submiting an empty name;
Fixed an issue where the game freezes after Deliriini's lines at the beginning;
Fixed an issue where the player enters void space when entering the Wheel of Fortune area;
Added a few possible answers to certain puzzles;
Adjusted the price of Sakura Bubble Gum.

Fixed a translation error;
Fixed the logic of the interaction tip star;
Fixed a visual element bug related to joystick connection;
Slightly changed the layout of credits.
